WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
Then why not come to my place for dinner tomorrow at noon?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,920
I didn’t let you come here in vain

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,520
You pretend to be my boyfriend and I’ll give you 1,000 yuan

4
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,720
what is a boyfriend

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,680
Boyfriend means you are almost my man

6
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:11,000
I asked you to pretend that my man gave you 1,000 yuan. Do you think you can pretend?

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,480
Can this thing still be fake?

8
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,760
What is the fate of the parents without saying anything? Pretending to say no, no, no

9
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:16,920
Not that far yet

10
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,000
Just get to know each other first

11
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,320
There is no talk of getting married and becoming husband and wife.

12
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:21,680
Do you understand what this means?

13
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,320
Do you like that car just now?

14
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,000
If you like it, I can lend it to you to play with.

15
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,440
You can ride back for me tomorrow and do this and that

16
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,520
If you want to come over tomorrow around 11 o'clock, be sure not to be late.

17
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,680
I'll prepare clothes for you at 11 o'clock

18
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,000
Just come to my place and put it on directly.

19
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,760
Also, your hair needs to be sorted when the time comes.

20
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:36,280
Can I go then? I can go. Here are the car keys.

21
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,930
Drive carefully

22
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:40,210
It seemed like someone pressed something just now

23
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:43,620
Are you pressing these keys? I'm sorry.

24
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,100
I forgot you came from a small mountain village

25
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,060
Never seen this thing

26
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,700
Let me press it for you and take a look

27
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,220
There are up and down keys

28
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,660
If you want to press the key, just put it down.

29
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,140
If you want to fuck, just press the button

30
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,260
The door opens and you go in

31
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:54,980
If you want to go to the 1st floor, just click on this 1

32
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:57,020
If you want to go to the 2nd floor, just click 2. Do you understand?

33
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,580
very simple

34
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,380
That's what happened. Thank you.
